<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-G OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-G OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.51 vs   0.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.97 vs   0.49</p>
<p> Sales		    9.22 vs   5.53</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.82 vs   1.17</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.76 vs   2.00</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.59 vs   2.41</p>
<p> Sales		   71.57 vs  46.75</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Mostostal</p>
<p>Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
